(7671331, 1252678, 30861, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, returning to comment. This is a well-constructed image from a technical perspective and it''s pleasing enough to look at, but in the end I can''t feel a lot of love for it. This is partly because the image is very "flat" from a lighting perspective, which is of course unavoidable given the overcast sky, but it''s not the best way to create a free-study image that will compete well against all the striking images that get entered. Arguably, if you''d processed more weight into the sky and did a radial vignette to subtly darken the image as we move away from the aloe plant you''d pick up a better score. In any case, I gave it a 6 and would expect it to finish in the 5.7-6.0 range.</td>', 'Voted earlier, returning to comment. This is a well-constructed image from a technical perspective and it''s pleasing enough to look at, but in the end I can''t feel a lot of love for it. This is partly because the image is very "flat" from a lighting perspective, which is of course unavoidable given the overcast sky, but it''s not the best way to create a free-study image that will compete well against all the striking images that get entered. Arguably, if you''d processed more weight into the sky and did a radial vignette to subtly darken the image as we move away from the aloe plant you''d pick up a better score. In any case, I gave it a 6 and would expect it to finish in the 5.7-6.0 range.', '2020-08-01 20:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
