(7672061, 1252561, 94815, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful poetry with impact. Thanks for that.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> It is difficult<br/>to get the news from parking lots<br/>                        yet men die miserably every day<br/>                                                for lack<br/>of what is found there. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thoughtful poetry with impact. Thanks for that. Originally posted by posthumous: It is difficultto get the news from parking lots                        yet men die miserably every day                                                for lackof what is found there. ', '2020-08-11 14:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
