(7672145, 1251591, 167023, '<td valign="top">Get a black light flashlight.  Check your plants with the light after dark.  The critters literally glow lime green.  Easy pesticide free way to deal with them.  You can find them even when they are tiny.  Can hardly miss them as they get larger.  If you have chickens, they make a tasty treat for them.</td>', 'Get a black light flashlight.  Check your plants with the light after dark.  The critters literally glow lime green.  Easy pesticide free way to deal with them.  You can find them even when they are tiny.  Can hardly miss them as they get larger.  If you have chickens, they make a tasty treat for them.', '2020-08-12 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
